  topic: Meeting Reconvened and Agenda Overview
  desc: The meeting was called back to order to continue discussions on the 2025-2026
    budget. The agenda included superintendent updates, board questions, board discussion,
    public comment, and final board comments.
- time: 00:00:45
  seconds: 45
  topic: 'Superintendent Updates: Athletic Complex Debt Service'
  desc: Superintendent Angela Atkinson Duina clarified that there is no debt service
